/* 11/13 아이디어 상세 (제이콥의 법칙: 이슈·피드백 게시판에서 익숙한 패턴) */
.idhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.idstat{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--fillc);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.idstat i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#7ee2a0}
.idshare{margin-left:auto;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #d6e1e9;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}
.idshare:hover{border-color:var(--brand)}
.idtitle{font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.iddesc{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink)}
.idmeta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)}.idmeta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.cav{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#dcdcd6;color:var(--ink);font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.cav.me{background:var(--fillc);color:#fff}
.cform{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:4px 0 8px}
.cform input{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:44px;border:1.5px solid #d6e1e9;border-radius:10px;padding:0 12px;font:inherit;background:#fff}
.cform .btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}
.cmt2{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.cmt2 li{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #e0e0db}
.cbody{flex:1;min-width:0}
.chead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:3px 0 4px;font-size:14px}.chead small{color:var(--ink2);font-size:13px}
.cown{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fbefc6;color:#7a5a00}
.ctext{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
.cacts{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:6px;margin-left:-8px}
.clike,.creply{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:32px;padding:0 8px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:none;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);cursor:pointer}
.clike:hover,.creply:hover{background:#e6e6e1}.clike.on{color:#c2410c}
.idlikebtn{width:100%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;background:var(--fillc);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
.idlikebtn.on{background:#fff;color:#c2410c;border-color:#c2410c}
.idjoinhint{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)}
.idmini{padding:6px 20px}
.imrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 0}
.imrow+.imrow{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.iml{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:15px}.iml b{font-size:15px}
.impill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:34px;padding:0 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--brand);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.impill.pri{background:var(--fillc);color:#fff}
.impill.idlikebtn{width:auto;justify-content:flex-start;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--brand)}
.impill.idlikebtn.on{color:#c2410c;border-color:#c2410c;background:#fff}
.iml{white-space:nowrap}
.imlink{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:0 0 12px;padding:0;border:0;background:none;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.imlink:hover{text-decoration:underline}
/* 11/13 포스트잇 쓰기: 한 줄 제목과 자세한 내용 칸 나눔, 상세 유형 태그는 노란 상자 안 */
#ideas .note-new{width:300px}
#ideas .note-new #noteText{flex:none;min-height:56px;font-weight:700}
#ideas .note-new .ndesc{flex:1;min-height:72px;border:0;border-top:1.5px dashed rgba(0,0,0,.2);padding-top:10px;background:transparent;resize:none;font:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;outline:0}
#ideas .note-new .ndesc::placeholder{color:rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.idtype{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-weight:700}
.impeople{list-style:none;margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.impeople li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px}
.impeople .cav{width:32px;height:32px;font-size:13px}
.imteams{width:100%;margin-bottom:16px}
.idtop{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.idtop .idtype{margin:0}.idtop .idmeta{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:rgba(0,0,0,.6)}.idtop .idmeta b{color:var(--ink)}
.idtop .cav{width:24px;height:24px;font-size:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}
/* 11/13 아이디어 상세를 Idea Board 포스트잇과 같은 모양으로: 같은 모눈 벽, 같은 종이색·테이프·리본·유형 라벨, 펼쳐지는 등장 */
#idea{--c-agent:#fcf1c8;--c-skill:#e1f2e6;--c-html:#e1edf5;--c-etc:#eeeafa}
.idboard{background-color:#eef3f7;background-image:radial-gradient(#c3d3df 1.1px,transparent 1.3px);background-size:18px 18px;border-radius:16px;padding:36px 32px 32px}
.bignote.idnote{position:relative;border-radius:1px;padding:30px 28px 26px;background:var(--c-etc);transform:rotate(-.6deg);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.idnote.t-agent{background:var(--c-agent)}.idnote.t-skill{background:var(--c-skill)}.idnote.t-html{background:var(--c-html)}
.idnote::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-10px;left:50%;width:84px;height:22px;margin-left:-42px;background:rgba(196,196,190,.72);z-index:3}
.idnote .idtop{position:relative;z-index:1}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.idnote{animation:idopen .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}}
@keyframes idopen{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9) rotate(-2deg)}}
@media(max-width:600px){.idboard{padding:24px 14px 18px}.bignote.idnote{padding:24px 18px 20px}.idnote .idtop{padding-right:64px}}
.idboard .idprog{margin:36px 0 0}.idboard .idbar{background:#d1d1d1}.idboard .pdot{border-color:#d6e1e9}.idboard .idprog li small{color:#5b5b5b}
/* 11/13 댓글 영역 슬림하게 */
.idcmt{margin-top:32px;padding:18px 20px 6px}
.idcmt h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 10px}
.idcmt .cform{margin:0 0 4px}.idcmt .cform input{min-height:40px}.idcmt .cform .btn{height:40px;min-height:40px}
.idcmt .cmt2 li{padding:12px 0;gap:10px}
.idcmt .chead{margin:2px 0 2px}
.idcmt .creply{height:24px;padding:0 6px;margin-left:2px}
.idcmt .ctext{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}
.imhint{margin:-8px 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.5}
.imstarted{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
.imstopbtn{color:var(--ink2);border-color:#d6e1e9}
.imstop{margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--fill)}
.imstop p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.imstop div{display:flex;gap:8px}
/* 11/13 Case 목록: Agent·Skill은 제목 옆 해시태그, 활용 제품은 색 상자 */
.cb-hash{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:22px;padding:0 8px;margin-left:6px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:2px;letter-spacing:.01em}
.cb-hash.h-agent{background:#fbe7a6;color:#6b4e00}.cb-hash.h-skill{background:#cdebd8;color:#1a6a3d}
.pc-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.pc{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:22px;padding:0;color:var(--ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
.pc::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--pcd,#999)}
.pc-cp{--pcd:#7c5cc4}.pc-cw{--pcd:#5b45b0}.pc-cs{--pcd:#6a52b8}.pc-xl{--pcd:#1d8a4e}.pc-wd{--pcd:#2b62c4}.pc-pp{--pcd:#d2552a}.pc-ol{--pcd:#1d7ac0}.pc-tm{--pcd:#5650c2}.pc-etc{--pcd:#999}
/* 11/13 Idea Board 탭 설명은 마우스를 올리거나 포커스하면 말풍선으로 */
.itabs [data-tip]{position:relative}
.itabs [data-tip]::after{content:attr(data-tip);position:absolute;left:50%;top:calc(100% + 10px);transform:translate(-50%,-4px);background:var(--fillc);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .15s,transform .15s;z-index:20}
.itabs [data-tip]:hover::after,.itabs [data-tip]:focus-visible::after{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
/* 11/13 검정 말풍선 공통(.tipx[data-tip]) — 고정 안내 문구 대신 */
.tipx{position:relative}
.tipx::after{font-style:normal}
.tipx::after{content:attr(data-tip);position:absolute;left:50%;top:calc(100% + 8px);transform:translate(-50%,-4px);background:var(--fillc);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .15s,transform .15s;z-index:30}
.tipx:hover::after,.tipx:focus-visible::after{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.itabs [data-tip]::after,.tipx::after{background:#1c1c1c}
.tipi{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:18px;height:18px;margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:1.5px solid var(--ink2);border-radius:50%;background:none;color:var(--ink2);font:700 11px/1 var(--font);font-style:italic;cursor:help;vertical-align:1px}
.askbtn{width:100%;margin-top:12px;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
/* 11/13 Skill·HTML 수정 모드: 업데이트 기록 필수 */
.uplog{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px}
.uplog textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
.uplog textarea[aria-invalid="true"]{border-color:#c62828}
.uperr{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#c62828;font-weight:600}
/* 11/13 Case 상세: 경로와 제목 사이 여백 */
#caseOut .cd-head{padding-top:28px}
@media(max-width:600px){#caseOut .cd-head{padding-top:18px}}
/* ==== 시안 style 블록 4 ==== */
/* ===== 11/18 배지 화면 단순화 (b3- 접두사): 그림과 이름만, 나머지는 상세로 ===== */
.b3-nx{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
.b3-nx>button{all:unset;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:pointer;flex:1;min-width:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,440px);gap:3px 18px;align-items:center;border-radius:12px}
.b3-nx>button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:4px}
.b3-nx .bdg-em{width:64px;height:64px;grid-row:1/4}
.b3-nx b{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-900)}
.b3-nx b small{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-left:6px}
.b3-nx p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)}
.b3-nx p em{font-style:normal;font-weight:800;color:var(--pri)}
.b3-nx .b2-pbar{grid-column:2;margin-top:6px}
.b3-go{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pri);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
.b3-go:hover{color:var(--pri-h)}
.b3-grp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:168px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:24px 0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
.b3-grp h3{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-900)}
.b3-grp h3 small{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink3)}
.b3-grp.done h3 small{color:var(--pri);font-weight:800}
.b3-grp .bdg-cells{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(128px,1fr));gap:4px 8px}
.bdg-cell.b3-cell .bdg-em{width:72px;height:72px}
.bdg-cell.b3-cell .bdg-c2{min-height:17px}
.bdg-dtop.b3-d{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}
.bdg-dtop.b3-d .b3-say{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5}
.bdg-dtop.b3-d .b3-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}
.b3-prog{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2);text-align:center}
.b3-prog .bdg-bar{height:4px;border-radius:2px;margin:0 0 8px;overflow:hidden}
.b3-rare{margin:18px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
.b3-rare b{color:var(--brand-900)}
@media(max-width:700px){.b3-grp{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}.b3-nx{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}}
/* ==== 시안 style 블록 5 ==== */
/* 11/18 배지 상세 창: 당근마켓처럼 가운데 정렬 (이름 → 안내 → 진행 → 획득 인원) */
.b3-k{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:8px 8px 0}
.b3-k .bdg-em{width:120px;height:120px;margin-bottom:16px}
.b3-k h2{margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:var(--brand-900)}
.b3-guide{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink)}
.b3-guide small{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}
.b3-how{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink3);margin-bottom:2px}
.b3-k .b3-prog{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:min(260px,100%);margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink2)}
.b3-bar{flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--hair2);overflow:hidden}
.b3-bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:3px}
.b3-cnt{margin:16px 0 0;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--gl);color:var(--gd);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
/* ==== 시안 style 블록 6 ==== */
/* 11/18 배지 14칸 한 격자 */
.b3-all{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(132px,1fr))!important;gap:12px 8px!important;padding-top:24px}
.b3-dots{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;margin-top:3px}
